---
config:
  flowchart:
    wrappingWidth: 400
---
flowchart TB
    accTitle: How an update of the blueprint arrives
    accDescr: Right after every release of the blueprint, and every week, the blueprint bot verifies the latest published release first. A release that is not immutable, whose tag is not on the main branch of the blueprint or that the release workflow of the blueprint didn't sign fails the run, and nothing is updated. Otherwise the bot runs copier update to that release. When its pull request is still open and you have committed to its branch, the bot leaves the branch to you and says once that a newer release is out. Otherwise it opens the pull request, or moves the open one on to the new release. With conflicts, which turn auto-merge off, or with BLUEPRINT_AUTOMERGE set to off, it waits for the maintainer; otherwise it merges itself once every check passes.

    bot(["Blueprint bot<br>after every release<br>and every week"])
    verified{"Release immutable,<br>on main, signed by<br>its release workflow?"}
    refused(["Fails the run<br>nothing is updated"])
    yours{"Your commits<br>on its open<br>pull request?"}
    note(["Leaves it to you<br>and says once that<br>a newer release is out"])
    pr["Pull request<br>with the changes<br>the open one moves on"]
    conflicts{"Conflicts?"}
    off{"Automerge<br>off?"}
    checks{"Every check<br>passes?"}
    merged["Merges itself"]
    wait(["Waits for<br>the maintainer"])

    bot -- "the latest<br>published release" --> verified
    verified -- "no" --> refused
    verified -- "yes: copier update" --> yours
    yours -- "yes" --> note
    yours -- "no" --> pr --> conflicts
    conflicts -- "no" --> off
    off -- "no" --> checks
    checks -- "yes" --> merged
    conflicts -- "yes: marked in the files<br>auto-merge off, labeled" --> wait
    off -- "yes" --> wait
    checks -- "no" --> wait

    classDef bot fill:#526cfe2e,stroke:#526cfe,stroke-width:2px
    classDef person fill:#f59e0b2e,stroke:#f59e0b,stroke-width:2px
    classDef done fill:#16a34a2e,stroke:#16a34a,stroke-width:2px
    class bot bot
    class wait,note,refused person
    class merged done
